    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Paul Lafferty Ltd Auctioneers are delighted to present New to the Market, this Inviting Three-Bedroom Bungalow with Mature Gardens on a large site of c. 0.37 acres at Taghnoose, Castlerea, Co. Roscommon.\r\n\r\nAccommodation briefly consists of an Entrance Hallway, Kitchen / Dining Room, Living Room, Bathroom and Three Bedrooms. The property also contains Oil-Fired Central Heating and a Stove in the Living Room.\r\n\r\nRoom Descriptions:\r\n•\tEntrance Hallway (1.05m x 2.38m): Wooden Flooring with entrance into Living Room and Bedroom 1.\r\n•\tLiving Room (4.4m x 3.5m): Carpet flooring with an Fireplace and insert solid fuel stove , Built-in Storage and Large Window Overlooking the Garden.\r\n•\tKitchen / Dining Room (4.28m x 3.88m): Tiled Flooring with Wooden Cabinets, Tiled Splash-Back Area, Stanley Solid-Fuel Range and Window Overlooking the Rear.\r\n•\tBathroom (3.22m x 1.5m): Large Family Bathroom with Tiled Flooring, Fully Tiled Shower Area and Cream Coloured Bath, Sink and Toilet.\r\n•\tBedroom 1 (3.6m x 3.57m): Timber Flooring with Fitted Wardrobe and Vanity Area, and Window Overlooking the Front.\r\n•\tBedroom 2 (2.2m x 3.5m): Timber Flooring, Wardrobe and Window Overlooking the Rear.\r\n•\tBedroom 3: Timber Flooring with Fitted Wardrobe and Shelving units. Currently used as Office Space.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property benefits from Mature Garden and Shrubbery, a Large Block-Built Double Garage with Lockable Doors, Wiring for a Generator and a Large Driveway with Ample Parking.\r\n\r\nThis Property is located in an Idyllic, Scenic Location, Surrounded by Countryside Views and just less than 15 minutes from Castlerea Town Centre. This property offers a Rare Opportunity to create a beautiful family or holiday home is a Picturesque, Rural Location.\r\n\r\nViewing is Highly Recommended and strictly by appointment with sole selling agents Paul Lafferty Ltd Auctioneers."
      },
